1575→ * Name: nxplayer_fforward
1576→ *
1577→ *   Selects to fast forward in the audio data stream.  The fast forward
1578→ *   operation can be canceled by simply selected no sub-sampling with
1579→ *   the AUDIO_SUBSAMPLE_NONE argument returning to normal 1x forward play.
1580→ *   This function may be called multiple times to change fast forward rate.
1581→ *
1582→ *   The preferred way to cancel a fast forward operation is via
1583→ *   nxplayer_cancel_motion() that provides the option to also return to
1584→ *   paused, non-playing state.
1585→ *
1586→ * Input Parameters:
1587→ *   pplayer   - Pointer to the context to initialize
